### Criar plano Básico
POST http://localhost:3000/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Básico",
  "price": 29.90
}

### Criar plano Pro
POST http://localhost:3000/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pro",
  "price": 59.90
}

### Criar plano Premium
POST http://localhost:3000/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Premium",
  "price": 99.90
}

### Listar todos os planos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/plans

### Buscar plano por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/plans/1

### Atualizar plano
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/plans/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Básico Plus",
  "price": 39.90
}

### Excluir plano
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/plans/1

### Listar novamente
GET http://localhost:3000/api/plans